sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant R as Redis
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant P as Prometheus
    participant G as Grafana
    B->>A: HTTP request with JWT
    A->>R: Rate-limit counter
    A->>A: Validate identity and authorization
    A->>D: Read or atomic transaction
    D-->>A: Result
    A-->>B: JSON with request ID and security headers
    P->>A: Scrape metrics
    A-->>P: Counts and duration buckets
    G->>P: Query time series
    P-->>G: Chart data
